<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AveragingWeightingMethodEnum#Weighted> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Weighted" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:AveragingWeightingMethodEnum ;
    skos:definition "The arithmetic mean of the relevant rates in effect for each day in a calculation period calculated by multiplying each relevant rate by the number of days such relevant rate is in effect, determining the sum of such products and dividing such sum by the number of days in the calculation period." .

