    skos:altLabel "KRW.SFEMC.INDICATIVE.SURVEY.RATE/KRW04" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Korean Won/U.S. Dollar Specified Rate for U.S. Dollars, expressed as the amount of Korean Won per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days, as published on SFEMC's website (www.sfemc.org) at approximately 3:30 p.m., Singapore time, or as soon thereafter as practicable, on such Rate Calculation Date. The Spot Rate will be calculated by SFEMC (or a service provider SFEMC may select in its sole discretion) pursuant to the SFEMC KRW Indicative Survey Methodology (which means a methodology, dated as of December 1, 2004, as amended from time to time, for a centralized industry-wide survey of financial institutions that are active participants in the Korean Won/U.S. Dollar markets for the purpose of determining the SFEMC KRW Indicative Survey Rate)." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#KRW_TELERATE_45644_KRW03> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "KRW_TELERATE_45644_KRW03" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "KRW.TELERATE.45644/KRW03" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Korean Won/U.S. Dollar market average rate, expressed as the amount of Korean Won per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days reported by the Korea Financial Telecommunications and Clearing Corporation which appears on Telerate Page 45644 to the right of the caption 'USD Today' that is available at approximately 3:30 p.m., Seoul time, on the Rate Calculation Date or as soon thereafter as practicable." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#KZT_EMTA_INDICATIVE_SURVEY_RATE_KZT02> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "KZT_EMTA_INDICATIVE_SURVEY_RATE_KZT02" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "KZT.EMTA.INDICATIVE.SURVEY.RATE/KZT02" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Kazakhstan Tenge / U.S. Dollar Specified Rate for U.S. Dollars, expressed as the amount of Kazakhstan Tenge per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement on the same Business Day, as published on EMTA's website (www.emta.org) at approximately 1:00 p.m., Almaty time, or as soon thereafter as practicable, on that Rate Calculation Date. The Spot Rate shall be calculated by EMTA (or a service provider EMTA may select in its sole discretion) pursuant to the EMTA KZT Indicative Survey Methodology (which means a methodology, dated as of March 16, 2009, as amended from time to time, for a centralized industry-wide survey of financial institutions that are active participants in the Kazakhstan Tenge/U.S. Dollar markets for the purpose of determining the EMTA KZT Indicative Survey Rate)." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#KZT_KASE_KZT01> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "KZT_KASE_KZT01" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "KZT.KASE/KZT01" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Kazakhstan Tenge / U.S. Dollar weighted average rate, expressed as the amount of Kazakhstan Tenge per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement on the same Business Day reported by the Kazakhstan Stock Exchange (www.kase.kz) at approximately 11:00 am, Almaty time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#LBP_BDLX_LBP01> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "LBP_BDLX_LBP01" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "LBP.BDLX/LBP01" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Lebanese Pound/U.S. Dollar Specified Rate, expressed as the amount of Lebanese Pounds per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days which appears on the Reuters Screen BDLX Page as of 12:00 noon, Beirut time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MAD_OFFICIAL_RATE_MAD01> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MAD_OFFICIAL_RATE_MAD01" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MAD.OFFICIAL.RATE/MAD01" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Moroccan Dirham/U.S. Dollar Specified Rate, expressed as the amount of Moroccan Dirham per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days reported by the Central Bank of Morocco as of 1:00 p.m., Rabat time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MXP_BNMX_MXP01> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MXP_BNMX_MXP01" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MXP.BNMX/MXP01" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Mexican Pesos/U.S. Dollar Specified rate, expressed as the amount of Mexican Pesos per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days reported by Banco de Mexico which appears on the Reuters Screen BNMX Page opposite the caption 'Fix' at the close of business in Mexico City on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MXP_FIXING_RATE_MXP02> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MXP_FIXING_RATE_MXP02" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MXP.FIXING.RATE/MXP02" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Mexican Peso/U.S. Dollar fixing rate, expressed as the amount of Mexican Pesos per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days which is published by Banco de Mexico in the Official Gazette of the Federation pursuant to the 'Disposiciones aplicables a la determinacion del tipo de Cambio para solventar obligaciones denominadas en moneda extranjera pagaderas en la Republica Mexicana' (Rules applicable to determine the exchange rate to pay obligations denominated in foreign currency payable in Mexico) on the first Business Day following that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MXP_MEX01_MXP03> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MXP_MEX01_MXP03" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MXP.MEX01/MXP03" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Mexican Peso/U.S. Dollar fixing rate, expressed as the amount of Mexican Pesos per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days reported by Banco de Mexico which appears on Reuters Screen MEX01 Page under the heading 'MXNFIX=RR', at the close of business in Mexico City on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MXP_PUBLISHED_MXP04> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MXP_PUBLISHED_MXP04" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MXP.PUBLISHED/MXP04" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Mexican Peso/U.S. Dollar fixing rate, expressed as the amount of Mexican Pesos per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days which is published by the Bolsa Mexicana de Valores, S.A. de C.V. (as established in Section 2 of the 'Resolution concerning the exchange rate applicable for calculating the Mexican Peso equivalent of principal and interest of Mexican Treasury Notes denominated in foreign currency and payable in Mexican Pesos' published in the Diario Oficial de la Federacion on November 11, 1991) in the Movimiento Diario del Mercado de Valores de la Bolsa Mexicana de Valores, S.A. de C.V. under the heading 'Movimiento Diario del Mercado de Valores' on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MYR_ABS_MYR01> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MYR_ABS_MYR01" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MYR.ABS/MYR01" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Malaysian Ringgit/U.S. Dollar spot rate at 11:00 a.m., Singapore time, expressed as the amount of Malaysian Ringgit per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days, reported by the Association of Banks in Singapore, which appears on the Telerate Page 50157 to the right of the caption 'Spot' under the column 'MYR' at approximately 11:30 a.m., Singapore time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MYR_KL_REF_MYR04> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MYR_KL_REF_MYR04" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MYR.KL.REF/MYR04" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Malaysian Ringgit/U.S. Dollar reference rate, expressed as the amount of Malaysian Ringgit per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days, calculated and reported by Bank Negara Malaysia as its Kuala Lumpur USD/MYR Reference Rate, which appears on Thomson Reuters Screen MYRFIX2 Page at approximately 3:30 p.m., Kuala Lumpur time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MYR_PPKM_MYR03> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MYR_PPKM_MYR03" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MYR.PPKM/MYR03" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Malaysian Ringgit/U.S. Dollar spot rate expressed as the amount of Malaysian Ringgit per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days, reported by Persatuan Pasaran Kewangan Malaysia (ACI - Malaysia), which appears on Thomson Reuters Screen MYRFIX2 Page at approximately 11:10 a.m., Kuala Lumpur time, on that Rate Calculation Date." .

<https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/SettlementRateOptionEnum#MYR_SFEMC_INDICATIVE_SURVEY_RATE_MYR02> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "MYR_SFEMC_INDICATIVE_SURVEY_RATE_MYR02" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf common_domain_model:SettlementRateOptionEnum ;
    skos:altLabel "MYR.SFEMC.INDICATIVE.SURVEY.RATE/MYR02" ;
    skos:definition "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Malaysian Ringgit/U.S. Dollar Specified Rate for U.S. Dollars, expressed as the amount of Malaysian Ringgit per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days, as published on SFEMC's website (www.sfemc.org) at approximately 3:30 p.m., Singapore time, or as soon thereafter as practicable, on such Rate Calculation Date. The Spot Rate will be calculated by SFEMC (or a service provider SFEMC may select in its sole discretion) pursuant to the SFEMC MYR Indicative Survey Methodology (which means a methodology, dated as of July 15, 2005, as amended from time to time, for a centralized industry-wide survey of financial institutions that are active participants in the Malaysian Ringgit/U.S. Dollar markets for the purpose of determining the SFEMC MYR Indicative Survey Rate)." .

