    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/PayRelativeToEnum#CalculationPeriodStartDate> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/PayRelativeToEnum#CalculationPeriodEndDate> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/PayRelativeToEnum#LastPricingDate> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/PayRelativeToEnum#ResetDate> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/PayRelativeToEnum#ValuationDate> ) ;
