    owl:unionOf ( <http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/asset-class-2-1#Commodity> <http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/asset-class-2-1#Credit> <http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/asset-class-2-1#Equity> <http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/asset-class-2-1#ForeignExchange> <http://www.fpml.org/coding-scheme/asset-class-2-1#InterestRate> <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AssetClassEnum#MoneyMarket> ) ;
