        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AdditionalTerminationEventEnum#AsSpecified>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AdditionalTerminationEventEnum#FailureToNotifyNAV>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AdditionalTerminationEventEnum#InvestmentAdvisor>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AdditionalTerminationEventEnum#KeyPersons>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/AdditionalTerminationEventEnum#NAVDeclineTrigger>,
